# Known vulnerabilities in the bundled JavaScript libraries, accepted until the expiry date.
# Format: <id> <expires YYYY-MM-DD> <reason>. Checked by ci/vendored-js.py.
# All 8 are not reachable in nsedit (checked 2026-11-25: which functions/widgets nsedit uses).
# Re-check when index.php starts using more of jQuery/jQuery UI. Upgrade: https://github.com/madv-zz/nsedit/issues/2
GHSA-6c3j-c64m-qhgq 2027-11-25 not reachable: jQuery 1.10.2 prototype pollution via $.extend(true, ...); jTable deep-merges server records, but their keys come from nsedit (no __proto__)
GHSA-jpcq-cgw6-v4j6 2027-11-25 not reachable: jQuery 1.10.2 XSS via <option> HTML; jTable builds options only from user and zone names that cannot contain HTML, table cells use .text()
GHSA-rmxg-73gg-4p98 2027-11-25 not reachable: jQuery 1.10.2 XSS via cross-domain ajax responses; nsedit only does same-origin requests
GHSA-9gj3-hwp5-pmwc 2027-11-25 not reachable: jQuery UI datepicker altField; the datepicker is not loaded
GHSA-gpqq-952q-5327 2027-11-25 not reachable: jQuery UI .position() 'of' option; only used internally by dialog with fixed values
GHSA-h6gj-6jjq-h8g9 2027-11-25 not reachable: jQuery UI checkboxradio; that widget is not loaded (not in 1.11)
GHSA-hpcf-8vf9-q4gj 2027-11-25 not reachable: jQuery UI dialog closeText; nsedit never sets closeText
GHSA-j7qv-pgf6-hvh4 2027-11-25 not reachable: jQuery UI datepicker *Text options; the datepicker is not loaded
